WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.505 --> 00:00:02.746
- [Voiceover] Gilbert Faku is a farmer.

00:00:02.746 --> 00:00:06.397
His homeland is remote,
near the bottom of Africa.

00:00:06.397 --> 00:00:09.249
His life, his wealth is in his farm

00:00:09.249 --> 00:00:11.026
and the herd of cattle he tends.

00:00:11.026 --> 00:00:12.813
But what he found in his backyard

00:00:12.813 --> 00:00:16.094
has brought him on an
extraordinary adventure.

00:00:16.094 --> 00:00:18.595
(light pop music)

00:00:18.595 --> 00:00:22.262
(speaking foreign language)

00:00:38.990 --> 00:00:41.090
During the centuries
of European navigation

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:43.587
toward the Indian Ocean,
ships frequently passed

00:00:43.587 --> 00:00:47.251
Gilbert's homeland on South
Africa's Eastern Cape.

00:00:47.251 --> 00:00:50.675
One such trip ran aground,
leaving countless spoils.

00:00:50.675 --> 00:00:54.025
And Gilbert is one of the
few who knows their location.

00:00:54.025 --> 00:00:57.692
(speaking foreign language)

00:01:08.979 --> 00:01:12.427
His finds are varied, usually
bits of porcelain and beads.

00:01:12.427 --> 00:01:14.077
But his most prized possession

00:01:14.077 --> 00:01:16.847
is what keeps him coming back.

00:01:16.847 --> 00:01:20.514
(speaking foreign language.

00:01:23.463 --> 00:01:26.218
It's a jewel-encrusted
pendant so valuable,

00:01:26.218 --> 00:01:28.164
yet he refuses to sell it,

00:01:28.164 --> 00:01:30.138
well, for money, that is.

00:01:30.138 --> 00:01:33.805
(speaking foreign language)

00:01:47.504 --> 00:01:50.921
(upbeat light pop music)

